This repository additionally bundles:

- `template/MMD to DIVA (A-POSE)_fork.blend` - rig work by FlyingSpirits within the
  BlenderDivaTools project (MIT, (c) 2024 ThisIsHH), carried and fixed forward by the fork.
- Format knowledge derived from studies of korenkonder/PD_Tool (mot set / a3da / pv_db
  command tables) and ThisIsHH's DIVA_BlenderCameraTool (MIT, (c) 2023 ThisIsHH).
- Statistics tables (`data/*.json`) measured from Project DIVA MEGA39's+ game data.
  The game itself is (c) SEGA; no game assets are included or redistributed here.
